        "instructions": "A pre-alert email arrives in the receiving mailbox. The subject says something like \"Pre-Alert Documents\" or \"APL USA // PRE-ALERT DOCUMENTATION\", though the wording and punctuation vary and it is usually a forward. Everything about one container belongs to the same validation, so several emails days apart are one shipment.",
